NOVA-EVO GEN 1 LOCKED

This directory is an immutable snapshot of the original GEN1
candidate generation, validation, screening, robust evaluation,
and Pareto-front results.

No GEN1 result is modified here.
GEN1 is a historical locked generation.
GEN2 was evolved from the GEN1 Pareto candidates.

The clean GEN0-UNSEEN-2 test was not used for GEN1 selection.
The final holdout dataset was not used for GEN1 selection.
